        "body": "<div>Booked by Michaela Imhof m.a.imhof@uva.nl Please share anything that will help prepare for our meeting. We are mainly interested in collecting EMA data in older adults and people with Parkinson's disease. Therefore, we are curious about the different types of EMA questions and how to make font size big or make buttons bigger to accommodate our participants. It would be great to see how to send reminders, and also how to set up a schedule with a mix of fixed questionnaires and randomised beeps each day.</div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:100%;\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\">\n<div> </div>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:100%;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: solid 1px #dadce0; padding: 24px 32px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top;\">\n<div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;padding:0;\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:28px;\">\n<a href=\"https://meet.google.com/ebv-yntt-vjh?hs=224\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://meet.google.com/ebv-yntt-vjh?hs=224\" target=\"_blank\"></a><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #1a73e8; padding: 10px 25px; border: none; margin: 0;\">Join with Google Meet</td></tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:24px;\"><div>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"padding-bottom: 4px;\"><tr><td><h2>Meeting link</h2></td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"color: #70757a;\"><a href=\"https://meet.google.com/ebv-yntt-vjh?hs=224\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://meet.google.com/ebv-yntt-vjh?hs=224\" target=\"_blank\">meet.google.com/ebv-yntt-vjh</a></div>\n</div></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:24px;\"><div>\n<a href=\"https://meet.google.com/ebv-yntt-vjh?hs=224\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://meet.google.com/ebv-yntt-vjh?hs=224\" target=\"_blank\">Test your setup</a> <span style=\"color: #70757a;\">any time before your appointment.</span>\n</div></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:24px;\"><div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"color: #70757a;\">New to Google Meet?</div>\n<a href=\"https://support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720\" target=\"_blank\">Learn more</a> <span style=\"color: #70757a;\">about getting started.</span>\n</div>\n<br><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"padding-bottom: 4px;\"><tr><td><h2>Join by phone</h2></td></tr></table>\n<span style=\"color: #70757a;\">(US) </span><a href=\"tel:+1-336-914-1076%3B409974070%23\">+1 336-914-1076</a> <br><span style=\"color: #70757a;\">PIN: 409974070</span><br><br><a href=\"https://tel.meet/ebv-yntt-vjh?pin=8894006980776&amp;hs=0\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://tel.meet/ebv-yntt-vjh?pin=8894006980776&amp;hs=0\" target=\"_blank\">More phone numbers</a><br>\n</div></td></tr>\n</table></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"padding-right: 32px; padding-left: 0;width:100%;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:0; vertical-align:top;\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:2px;\"><div style=\"color: #3c4043;\">Meeting with Avicenna (Amin Tavassolian) (Michaela Imhof)</div></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:24px;\"><div style=\"color: #3c4043;\">\n<span><time datetime=\"20241023T140000Z\"></time><time datetime=\"20241023T143000Z\"></time></span>Wednesday Oct 23, 2024 ⋅ 7am – 7:30am (Pacific Time - Los Angeles) </div></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:24px;\"><div style=\"color: #3c4043;\"><span><b>Booked by</b><br>Michaela Imhof<br><a href=\"mailto:m.a.imhof@uva.nl\">m.a.imhof@uva.nl</a><br><br><b>Please share anything that will help prepare for our meeting.</b><br>We are mainly interested in collecting EMA data in older adults and people with Parkinson's disease. Therefore, we are curious about the different types of EMA questions and how to make font size big or make buttons bigger to accommodate our participants. It would be great to see how to send reminders, and also how to set up a schedule with a mix of fixed questionnaires and randomised beeps each day.</span></div></td></tr>\n</table></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:100%;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding:4px 12px;\" align=\"left\"><div style=\"color: #70757a;\">\n<p>Powered by <a href=\"https://workspace.google.com/resources/appointment-scheduling/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://workspace.google.com/resources/appointment-scheduling/\" target=\"_blank\">Google Calendar appointment scheduling</a>. Use is subject to the <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\" target=\"_blank\">Google Privacy Policy</a> and <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/terms\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://policies.google.com/terms\" target=\"_blank\">Terms of Service</a>.</p>\n<p>You are receiving this email because you are included on the guest list for this booked appointment.</p>\n<p>Forwarding this invitation could allow any recipient to cancel on your behalf.</p>\n</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>",
